---
// Reuses the shared waitlist modal wired in BaseLayout via id="open-waitlist-modal".
---

<section id="build">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="final-cta">
      <span class="eyebrow"><span class="spark">✦</span> Hirime Resume Builder</span>
      <h2>Put your skills into a resume that <span class="serif-em">gets noticed.</span></h2>
      <p>Use Hirime to build your resume, improve your content with AI, and tailor it to the jobs you want. Currently preparing for launch — join for early access.</p>
      <div class="fc-actions">
        <button type="button" id="open-waitlist-modal" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Join Hirime Resume Builder</button>
        <a class="btn btn-outline btn-lg" href="#generator">Generate skills first</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
